  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>無鞍騎馬（Bareback Horse Riding）允許玩家在不裝備馬鞍的情況下騎乘馬匹。您可以直接帶走剛剛發現的馬，無需將其遺留並前往地牢寶箱翻找馬鞍。預設情況下，不裝馬鞍騎馬會為玩家和馬匹施加「緩慢」效果。您也可以在設定檔中啟用每 15 秒受到一次傷害的功能。穿著皮革褲可以防止緩慢或傷害，但每次成功抵消時都會降低其耐久度。所有功能皆可自訂設定，各項特性亦可自由開關。<br><br>馴服功能保持不變。馬匹必須先變為友好狀態並完成馴服後，方可進行操控。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>玩家在無鞍騎馬時（馬匹也會），是否應獲得緩慢效果。<br><br><span><strong>shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>玩家在無鞍騎馬時，是否應受到傷害。<br><br><span><strong>leatherPantsNegateEffect</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>若已啟用，穿著皮革褲是否能在無鞍騎馬時防止玩家受傷或獲得緩慢效果。<br><br><span><strong>ticksBetweenDamage</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：300，最小值：1，最大值：72000<br>若已啟用，玩家無鞍騎馬時每隔多少「刻」（ticks）受到一次傷害。1 秒 = 20 刻。<br><br><span><strong>halfHeartDamageAmount</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：2，最小值：1，最大值：100<br>無鞍騎馬時對玩家造成的傷害量（以半顆心為單位）。<br><br><span><strong>leatherPantsLoseDurabilityOnNegation</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>皮革褲每次成功抵銷傷害時，是否應消耗耐久度。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>馬匹可在無鞍狀態下騎乘：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>啟用 'shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 後將施加緩慢效果：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>或啟用 'shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 後偶爾造成傷害：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>穿著皮革褲可防止緩慢或傷害發生。此功能會消耗耐久度：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
